# Marker written while a mutation is live in the source; a killed run leaves it
# behind on purpose so the next run refuses to start.
backend/evaluation/.mutation-in-progress

# Wrangler's local state, created by `npx wrangler deploy`. Not build output:
# .wrangler/cache/wrangler-account.json holds the Cloudflare ACCOUNT ID, which
# has no business in a public git history. The Worker source that matters is
# deploy/cloudflare-worker.js and wrangler.toml, both tracked.
.wrangler/
